,{"link_type":31},{"title":229,"desktopColumns":230},"Enjoy all these features as standard",2,"card_carousel$7cfd8d72-8785-4b27-98fb-f136a38ae2fd",{"variation":12,"version":13,"items":233,"primary":234,"id":251,"slice_type":252,"slice_label":16},[],{"CardImage":235,"CardAvatar":242,"CardTitle":243,"CardText":244,"ButtonText":163,"ButtonUrl":248,"IsEco":134},{"dimensions":236,"alt":16,"copyright":16,"url":239,"id":240,"edit":241},{"width":237,"height":238},1053,651,"business.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaOUkX55xUNkB1sWa_Evri_Premium_logo-1-.png?auto=format,compress","aOUkX55xUNkB1sWa",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},"none","A new Evri Premium service –  a network of DHL",[245],{"type":20,"text":246,"spans":247,"direction":23},"Following the merger of Evri and DHL eCommerce, we will offer a range of new premium services to help grow your business. Speak to your Evri Business account manager to learn more.",[],{"link_type":26,"key":249,"url":250},"2fdd8fb8-c9b4-4dcc-a6f3-adc72f6ff6cc","business.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fevri-premium-dhl","card$0017961d-df46-4e10-bd2f-e650667f9e71","card",{"variation":254,"version":13,"items":255,"primary":256,"id":265,"slice_type":252,"slice_label":16},"cardWithTelephoneAndCta",[],{"CardTitle":257,"CardAvatar":258,"CardText":259,"ButtonText":263,"ButtonLabel":263,"telephoneNumber":264},"Need help with something else?","friendly",[260],{"type":20,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":23},"Call us if you need a customer service advisor to investigate a problem with your parcel’s delivery, collection, payment or label. Unfortunately, our customer service advisors cannot help with business account queries.",[],"Call 0330 808 5458","03308085458","card$0015db64-df8f-4b44-8f9f-5055677217a1",{"variation":267,"version":13,"items":268,"primary":305,"id":307,"slice_type":204,"slice_label":16},"4BlueCards",[269,278,288,294],{"quote":270,"companyLogo":271,"companyName":273,"jobTitle":277},"Service has been consistently high all year resulting in low Customer services contact",{"dimensions":272,"alt":273,"copyright":16,"url":274,"id":275,"edit":276},{"width":80,"height":80},"River Island","business.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZo5Cgh5LeNNTw-u7_river_island.svg?auto=compress,format","Zo5Cgh5LeNNTw-u7",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},"Head of Fulfilment",{"quote":279,"companyLogo":280,"companyName":283,"jobTitle":287},"Ensuring that we meet delivery promise and reliability are two of our most important metrics when reviewing couriers and since this transition we have benefitted from both, as they have either met or exceeded their SLA.",{"dimensions":281,"alt":283,"copyright":16,"url":284,"id":285,"edit":286},{"width":282,"height":282},652,"Gymshark","business.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZtWNsUaF0TcGJqqQ_gymshark.svg","ZtWNsUaF0TcGJqqQ",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},"Delivery Solutions Manager",{"quote":289,"companyLogo":290,"companyName":88,"jobTitle":293},"They have coped with our demand, beaten the agreed SLA and saved us money in the process. Well done, Evri.",{"dimensions":291,"alt":88,"copyright":16,"url":89,"id":90,"edit":292},{"width":80,"height":80},{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},"Head of Supply Chain",{"quote":295,"companyLogo":296,"companyName":300,"jobTitle":304},"We are immensely pleased with Evri's exceptional performance. Their unwavering commitment to stability and efficiency has been truly commendable. We are excited about the prospect of strengthening our relationship with Evri across other European markets.",{"dimensions":297,"alt":300,"copyright":16,"url":301,"id":302,"edit":303},{"width":298,"height":299},1500,404,"Zooplus","business.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZtWNXEaF0TcGJqp-_zooplus_logo.svg","ZtWNXEaF0TcGJqp-",{"x":40,"y":40,"zoom":41,"background":42},"Global Director Last Mile Delivery",{"title":306},"Here’s what our partners are saying","card_carousel$23a59d12-cace-4e11-ae08-12bc6f1bb5be",{"variation":12,"version":13,"items":309,"primary":343,"id":345,"slice_type":346,"slice_label":16},[310,316,322,328],{"questionTitle":311,"questionBody":312},"Do I get an account manager?",[313],{"type":20,"text":314,"spans":315,"direction":23},"All SME and Corporate clients will receive a dedicated Account Manager who will be responsible in supporting you and your business’s future growth.",[],{"questionTitle":317,"questionBody":318},"Can I track my parcels?\u2028",[319],{"type":20,"text":320,"spans":321,"direction":23},"All parcels are fully tracked from entry into Evri network through to their destination.\u2028",[],{"questionTitle":323,"questionBody":324},"Can I integrate my Evri account with my business to ship parcels?\u2028",[325],{"type":20,"text":326,"spans":327,"direction":23},"Depending on your account level, you can integrate your Evri account with up to 90 marketplaces, ecommerce platforms, and warehouse management systems.\u2028",[],{"questionTitle":329,"questionBody":330},"Do I need to be a registered business to trade with Evri?\u2028",[331],{"type":20,"text":332,"spans":333,"direction":23},"Anyone can trade with Evri, even if you haven’t registered as a business. You can simply create a Frequent Seller account to get started straight away or enquire about our SME or Corporate accounts using this form. Our team will be in touch to set up your Business Account soon.",[334,341],{"start":335,"end":336,"type":337,"data":338},209,213,"hyperlink",{"link_type":26,"url":339,"target":340},"business.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fbusiness\u002Fenquiry-form\u002Fbusiness-details","_self",{"start":335,"end":336,"type":342},"strong",{"title":344},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$68032792-045d-4b6e-be7a-116a38575878","frequently_asked_questions",[11,48,121,156,205,232,253,266,308],{"cardsArray":349},[350,375,396],{"id":125,"uid":16,"url":16,"